<title>UK: TABLE-Tesco yr pretax profit rises 10.1 pct.</title>
<headline>TABLE-Tesco yr pretax profit rises 10.1 pct.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to February 22, 1997</p>
<p>			   (million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (pence)		24.1		   vs 22.2</p>
<p> Dividend (pence)	 7.1		    vs n/a</p>
<p> Total dividend (pence) 10.35		  vs 9.60</p>
<p> Pretax		     750		    vs 681</p>
<p> Turnover		   14,984		 vs 13,028</p>
<p>NOTE - Analysts had forecast pre-tax profits in a range between 745 million and 755 million stg. Fully diluted earnings per share totalled 23.5p in 1997 after 21.6p a year earlier. The pretax figure excludes the net loss on disposal of fixed assets. Full name of the British store group is Tesco Plc.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 171 542 4017</p>
</text>
